<title>USA: Fed says overnight system RPs totaled $4.879 bln.</title>
<headline>Fed says overnight system RPs totaled $4.879 bln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve said that it added $4.879 billion in temporary reserves to the banking system through overnight system repurchase agreements on Tuesday.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1867))</p>
</text>
